{"id":"424566","name":"罗宋汤","author":"冷水浮萍","authorId":"1822395","desc":"","cover":"images/424566/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腩","amount":"一斤"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"一个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"一根"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"一个"},{"name":"西芹","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄沙司","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"炖肉料","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛腩切成方块，泡半个小时，泡出血水。","img":"images/424566/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洋葱切丝，西红柿切块。","img":"images/424566/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"土豆胡萝卜切小块。","img":"images/424566/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"牛腩清炖20分钟，放黄酒、姜片和豆蔻。","img":"images/424566/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热油锅炒洋葱。","img":"images/424566/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒番茄。","img":"images/424566/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒土豆。","img":"images/424566/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒胡萝卜。","img":"images/424566/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把多有菜放入牛肉汤，电高压锅30分钟。","img":"images/424566/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入西芹。","img":"images/424566/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/424566/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/424566/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}